          "text": "47",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasengibuyisela ngasemnyango wethempeli, ngabona amanzi egobhoza ngaphansi kwedundulu lomnyango wethempeli eqonda empumalanga, ngoba ithempeli lalikhangele impumalanga; amanzi ayegeleza ngakwesokunene ngeningizimu kwealtare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 14:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joha 7:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isam 22:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasengikhupha ngendlela yesango langasenyakatho, wangibhodisa ngaphandle kwesango elingaphandle elikhangele impumalanga. Amanzi ayegeleza ngaseningizimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waseqonda empumalanga ephethe intambo esandleni sakhe, waselinganisa ingalo eziyizinkulungwane, wasengidabulisa phakathi kwamanzi, ayefika enqagaleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waselinganisa futhi ingalo eziyizinkulungwane, wangidabulisa phakathi kwamanzi, akhawula emadolo. Walinganisa futhi ingalo eziyizinkulungwane, wangidabulisa phakathi kwamanzi, afika okhalweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walinganisa futhi ingalo eziyizinkulungwane, aba ngumfula engahluleka ukuwuchapha, ngoba amanzi ayesephakeme, esilingene ukuntsheza, esengumfula owawungeke wachatshwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kimi: Ndoda, ukubonile lokhu na? Wasengibuyisela emuva enginqumisa ukhumbi lomfula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekubuyeleni kwami ngabona okhunjini lomfula izihlahla ezinengi kakhulu inxa zonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kimi: Lamanzi agelezela endaweni ezingasempumalanga, aze ehlele eAraba; nxa esengena emanzini emiyo olwandle, azakuba matsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho umfula udlula khona zonke izidalwa eziphilayo ezigcwele umhlaba zizaphila; kuzakuba khona inhlanzi ezinengi kakhulu, ngoba lamanzi eza lapho ukuba amanye enziwe abe mahle; lapho egeleza khona konke kuzakuphila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagoli benhlanzi bazakuma phansi kolwandle, kusukela eEngedi kuze kube seEnegilayimi kuzakuba yindawo yokugola inhlanzi. Inhlanzi zalo zizakuba ngezenhlobo ezinengi njengenhlanzi zoLwandle olukhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa amatete awo lamaxhaphozi awo kawayikuba lamanzi amatsha. Azakuba zindawo zetshwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkunjini zombili zomfula kuzakhula zonke inhlobo zezihlahla ezidliwayo. Amahlamvu azo kawayikubuna, lezithelo zazo kaziyikuphutha, zizathela izithelo ezintsha inyanga zonke, ngoba amanzi azo avela endlini engcwele. Izithelo zazo zizakuba ngezokudliwa, lamahlamvu azo abe ngawokwelapha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Nansi imingcele elizakwahlukanisa ngayo izizwe zakoIsrayeli ezilitshumi lambili ilizwe libe yilifa lazo. UJosefa uzakuba lezigaba ezimbili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizalahlukanisa ngokulinganayo; ngafunga ukulinika okhokho benu, lelilizwe lizakuba ngelenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanku umngcele welizwe; ngasenyakatho kusukela oLwandle olukhulu kuyedlula eHethiloni kuze kube sekungeneni eHamathi, kudlulele eZedadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leBerotha leSibiriyami, elisemngceleni phakathi kweDamaseko leHamathi, kuze kufike eHazeri‐Hatikoni elisemngceleni weHawurani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakuba njalo umngcele usukela olwandle usiya eHazari‐Enoni, elingasemngceleni weDamaseko ongasenyakatho, lomngcele weHamathi ngasenyakatho. Lo uzakuba ngumngcele wasenyakatho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasempumalanga umngcele uzasuka eHazari‐Enoni phakathi kweHawurani leDamaseko, ulandele iJordani phakathi kweGileyadi lelizwe lakoIsrayeli, uze ufike ngasolwandle olungasempumalanga uyefika eTamari. Lo uzakuba ngumngcele wasempumalanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaseningizimu uzasuka eTamari uze ufike ngasemanzini aseMeribathi‐Kadeshi, usuke lapho uye ngasemfuleni waseGibithe uyefika oLwandle olukhulu. Lo uzakuba ngumngcele waseningizimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasentshonalanga, uLwandle olukhulu luzakuba ngumngcele ngasentshonalanga kuze kufike maqondana laseHamathi. Lo uzakuba ngumngcele wasentshonalanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokunjaloke lizalahlukanisa ilizwe ezizweni zakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilabe libe ngelenu lelabezizwe abahlala phakathi kwenu, bezala abantwana phakathi kwenu. Bazakuba njengamadodana azalelwe koIsrayeli. Kanye lani bazakwabelwa ilizwe phakathi kwezizwe zakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakusiphi isizwe owezizwe ahlala kiso lizakumabela lapho ilizwe lakhe, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
